<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="9fd9e7d2">&lt;p&gt;
    This artifact details configuration and installation requirements needed to support test execution in the test
    environment. Specifications for the test environment include, but are not limited to:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Basic software requirements 
        &lt;ul&gt;
            &lt;li style=&quot;LIST-STYLE-TYPE: circle&quot;&gt;
                For example, operating system and other tools such as email
            &lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;/ul&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Basic hardware requirements 
        &lt;ul&gt;
            &lt;li style=&quot;LIST-STYLE-TYPE: circle&quot;&gt;
                For example, processors, memory storage, hard disk storage, other input and output devices
            &lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;/ul&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Connectivity to ancillary applications or external vendor supported systems
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Frequency of batch cycles
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Special software and hardware requirements 
        &lt;ul&gt;
            &lt;li style=&quot;LIST-STYLE-TYPE: circle&quot;&gt;
                For example, printers and sensor devices
            &lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;/ul&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Frequency of data refresh
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        List of files and reports needed for testing from test environment
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Special job requirements
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
</Element>
